WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.950
<i>This intensity... It's just like Eris!</i>

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.640
<i>She's a Hyral Menas!</i>

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.770
Get 'em!

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.250
<i>Truly fortune favors me, that a Hyral Menas should be among my opponents!</i>

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.040
<i>Could there be any better way 
to test the fruits of my training?</i>

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.450
You're a Hyral Menas, right?

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.330
A Hyral Menas?

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:28.220
Rani, protect Seilyn and the others.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.290
I'll handle her!

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:32.010
Y-Yeah...

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:35.680
You sure do look happy at times like these.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.540
Oh, you can tell?

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.870
You're grinning from ear to ear.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.350
A-Am I?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.870
Anyway, keep them all safe, okay?

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.020
Got it!

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.730
I ask that you fight me instead.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.680
Is this some kind of joke?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.190
A weak girl like you 
stands no chance against me.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.670
<i>Now, I'll just convert my aether to mana...</i>

00:00:59.010 --> 00:00:59.990
What?

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.010
<b><u>Reborn</u></b>

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.010
<b>to Master the Blade
\h\h\h\h\hFrom Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire\h\h\h\h\h</b>

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.010
<b>to Master the Blade
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire</b>

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:38.010
<b>Episode 4    The Town Ruled by the Highlander</b>

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.090
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:38.590
<i>Inglis's mana is this strong?</i>

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.030
Burst! Shiny Flow!

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:54.290
Please don't hold back.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.310
Very well.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:00.520
I've been bored lately without 
any good foes to fight.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:03.600
<i>She's so aggressive! I love it!</i>

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.540
<i>I'm liking her more and more by the second!</i>

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.130
I think we'll get along.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.750
I was just thinking the same thing.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.890
Bratty little girl...

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.760
Draw your sword.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:16.790
That won't be necessary.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:17.710
What?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.800
It's uselessly dull.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:25.310
Time to find out if your words are true.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:34.530
An ordinary knight would've been run through 
before they could move a muscle.

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:37.730
Of course, if you couldn't dodge 
this much, it'd be no fun at all!

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:44.590
<i>She's maintaining her distance at all times, 
even as she attacks with her spear!</i>

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.360
<i>Very good!</i>

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:53.540
<i>She keeps closing the distance 
with each attack I make.</i>

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.470
You're out of room to fall back.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.280
Nice attack!

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.470
Mine wasn't half bad either.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:15.390
<i>Very good. She's strong enough to stand up 
right after a hit like that.</i>

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:20.150
<i>And her desire to fight hasn't dulled at all!</i>

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.600
<i>Excellent!</i>

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:25.230
You have so much power.

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:27.820
Why are you serving a Highlander?

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.940
Her kind are trying 
to steal away the surface.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:34.990
You're not just letting that happen. 
You're actively helping them.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:38.810
Well, Lady Seilyn seems nice.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.660
And the people in town seemed to like her.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:45.140
If you only look at what's 
happening on the surface, sure.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.700
Surface?

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.220
You didn't notice something 
wrong about the town?

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:52.240
The flow of mana?

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.180
What about it?

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:57.140
If you noticed, then look into it yourself.

00:04:57.140 --> 00:05:00.850
And realize for yourself 
how foolish your deeds are.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.110
I'd be lying if I said 
I wasn't a bit curious.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:08.030
But unfortunately, 
I'm not here to play hero!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:13.490
I was just helping her to earn some money 
after we ate too much and spent it all.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.100
To earn money?

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.450
And thanks to that, I got to fight you!

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.140
So I'm grateful to all that food I ate.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:23.750
What use is power without justice?

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.710
I get to have fun! That's all!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.260
Fool!

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:33.060
I refuse to let somebody 
like you have such power!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.120
You did well to dodge that.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.580
<i>An attack that ignores space and distance...</i>

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.120
<i>So this is her true, hidden power.</i>

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.540
<i>Now this is getting interesting!</i>

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.800
She keeps moving around...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.090
<i>I've been waiting for this!</i>

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.450
So, what will you do now?

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.590
Fool! You've also stopped moving!

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:09.750
<i>So she can kick, not just use her spear?</i>

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.300
<i>She knew what I'd do, too...</i>

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.310
Now you're mine!

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.320
What?

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.370
That was a good fight, huh?

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:30.920
I had more fun than I thought I would.

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:37.940
How will I ever face them now?

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:39.200
Chris!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.970
I dealt with the enemies outside!

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:45.930
Chris...

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.180
Rani!

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.880
I can't let myself be captured here.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.170
Let me go, if you value her life.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.360
Chris...

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.980
Go, then.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.350
But may I say one thing?

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:11.490
You're free to do whatever 
you want when fighting me.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:15.040
Flee as many times as you like, 
if you think things aren't going your way.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:20.530
However, if you ever hurt Rani again...

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.600
You're a dead woman.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:26.640
That's all.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.460
Have a nice evening.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.220
What's your name?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.680
Inglis Eucus.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.340
A pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.280
Sistia Rouge.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:37.520
Until we meet again...

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:42.980
Rani!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.370
Are you okay?

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:47.140
I'm okay.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.400
Sorry...

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.330
I guess I interrupted you.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.120
No, I was done.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.150
So were you, right?

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:57.190
Yes.

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:59.490
Lady Seilyn's safe.

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.470
Our mission's complete.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:02.920
Yup.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:08.000
Thank you so much for your help yesterday.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.530
Thanks to you, none of my men were injured.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.710
I'm glad we could help.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:18.930
Are the former knights we captured 
going to be executed?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:24.220
No, they were once loyal 
servants of this city.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.470
They simply got a little arrogant.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:31.600
I want them to change their ways and 
use their strength not for themselves,

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:36.300
but for the weak and powerless.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.570
I plan on taking my time 
to persuade them of this.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:45.320
And if they're willing to change, 
I'm going to hire them again.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.670
Wow! And to think they tried to kill you!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.700
I think that's wonderful.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.320
Oh? This has an unusual taste.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:02.550
Yes. I thought you might be tired from 
yesterday, so I've added some herbs to it.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:03.960
I see.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:08.320
I do feel relaxed, 
like I could sleep very well.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.440
Yes, it's good.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.740
It is.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.380
There's something I want 
to talk to you about.

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.280
Will you come with me?

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.400
Y-Yes?

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.620
I didn't realize there was a place 
like this under the castle.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.850
Only a select few know of it.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:33.410
That's...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:43.430
This magic circle is draining away mana.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:47.220
Lady Seilyn... What is this?

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:52.380
The core of the Highland. 
A Levitation Circle.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:57.620
It absorbs mana from its surroundings, 
and when it has enough,

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:01.780
it breaks the land away from the earth 
around it and brings it to the sky.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:02.970
The sky?

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:05.100
Does that mean...?

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.490
It will become a new Highland.

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:10.680
Her kind are trying 
to steal away the surface.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:14.510
<i>I thought she meant in the
political or psychological sense.</i>

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:18.390
<i>I didn't think she literally meant they 
were stealing the surface itself...</i>

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.500
If it flies up into the sky,

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.060
what happens to the people who live here?

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:28.170
The Highland is for Highlanders.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:32.310
They'll either have to leave or become 
slaves of Highlanders themselves.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:36.710
I'm planning on asking the higher-ups 
to let those who wish live here

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:40.920
without becoming slaves, or even allow them 
to become Highlanders themselves.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.790
Can you do that?

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:46.480
I will. Even if I have to fight the Highland.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.350
Why are you telling us 
something so important?

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:54.600
Because I wanted somebody 
to forgive me, I guess.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:11:01.470
My being here as this city's ruler 
means it may someday be destroyed.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:08.470
But I'm hiding that from everyone... 
and I don't know if that's okay.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.440
So I want to ask you...

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.250
Is it okay for me to be here?

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:19.110
If not, you may strike me down where I stand.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.780
C-Chris, what do we say?

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:26.610
She's asking you for your opinion.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:29.750
You need to tell her what you think.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.710
What about you, Chris?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:36.710
Me? I'll go with whatever you say.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.920
I'm going to be your squire, after all.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.790
That's not fair!

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:43.330
That's what it means to be the boss!

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:45.380
Okay...

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:47.390
Lady Seilyn...

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.740
I want to believe in you.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:56.020
Because I think you believe what you say.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:58.040
Rafinha...

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:05.490
When this land takes flight, if you 
need my power, I'll come to help you.

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:10.360
I'm going to train at the knights' academy 
in the capital and study hard!

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.960
I'll be able to help you more then!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:17.090
So when that happens, 
take me on as a knight here!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.550
Thank you, Rafinha...

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:25.580
This is okay, right, Chris?

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:28.230
It's what I've decided for myself.

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.150
It's fine.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:33.860
If things go well, we might get 
to fight a Highlander army!

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:36.800
That's not going well at all!

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.140
What was that? An earthquake?

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:01.770
I heard voices from this direction!

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:03.340
Be careful, Rani!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.270
A magicite beast!

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.490
That's...

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:21.330
No... Is that Lady Seilyn?

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.910
Why? There hasn't been any Prism Flow!

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:28.850
Rani, remember what 
happened three years ago.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:30.270
Three years ago?

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:39.890
Rahl was turned into a magicite beast 
by the Bloodchain Brigade's Prism Powder.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:43.390
So this is the Bloodchain Brigade again?

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.970
The question is... when?

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.170
Pathetic!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.890
Now begone, Highlander!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.550
Mimoza?!

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.820
So <i>that's</i> where the Prism Powder was?

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.150
My son was killed by a Highlander!

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:10.120
Go to hell!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.660
Magicite beasts! Split up!

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.850
Wait!

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:23.640
You need to evacuate the people in the castle!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:24.920
But...

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.060
Leave this to us! Hurry!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.100
Understood.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.300
What do we do, Chris?

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.140
We have to stop her.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.380
Rani, if she looks like she's going to fire 
another one of those beams, block her!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:36.890
Got it!

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:44.500
Lady Seilyn, stop this, please!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.850
No, Lady Seilyn!

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.170
You're...

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:16.380
Die!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.600
Stop it!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.530
Don't interfere! 
I didn't come here to fight you!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.850
You're with the Bloodchain 
Brigade, aren't you?

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.440
And what if I am?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:34.660
If I'd defeated you then, Mimoza wouldn't 
have gotten her hands on the Prism Powder.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.810
No, that's not true.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:42.320
My comrades all carry Prism Powder.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:44.870
Comrade Mimoza already had it.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.290
<i>When did he show up?</i>

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:52.110
The plan to use the banished knights 
to attack the Highlander failed.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:55.180
So Comrade Mimoza took action on her own.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.560
And who might you be?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.680
I am the leader of the Bloodchain Brigade.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.690
I have no name. Call me what you like.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.140
I've come to protect this land.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:10.620
From the danger that you people created?

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:15.580
We will eliminate the Highlander, 
but the people of this land are innocent.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.780
I won't let you hurt either of them.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.390
Chris! We need to stop her!

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.510
Get out of here.

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.540
I won't let you!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:46.560
<i>I didn't think anyone could take a clean hit 
from my Aether-Shell-enhanced fist.</i>

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.610
<i>It seems I still have much 
to see of the world!</i>

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.150
Step aside!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.790
Sorry, but I can't.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.840
<i>Amazing!</i>

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:02.250
<i>I'd love to have a nice, long fight 
with him, but now's not the time!</i>

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.090
You're mine.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:13.920
Not on my watch!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.580
Then I'll take you out first!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:17.880
Lady Seilyn!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:21.100
Lady Seilyn, are you okay?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.050
Are you hurt?

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:27.020
Are you in pain, Lady Seilyn?

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.990
No! Sistia!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:29.750
Yes!

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.700
Lady Seilyn!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.180
Run!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:34.100
What's wrong?

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.450
Are you okay?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.360
Lady Seilyn?

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.360
That's...

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.980
Lady Seilyn!

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.440
No!

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:52.130
Lady Seilyn, no!

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:02.240
Chris!

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:05.840
What are you doing? 
You should've allowed her a clean death!

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:09.460
Lady Seilyn is still in there!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:12.030
We can't let her die!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.750
But nothing's changed.

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:17.280
There's something I want to try.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.620
Distract her.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:23.280
If I fail, I'll let you do as you like.

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:27.360
Very well. Let's make a deal.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:33.000
Whether this works or not, 
when it's over, you leave the city.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:36.130
We're going to destroy 
the Levitation Circle,

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.050
and I don't want you trying to interfere.

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.640
Very well.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:44.220
I'm sorry I won't get a chance to fight you.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.230
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.760
We have a deal.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:51.440
Sistia, distract her!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.920
Understood!

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:54.130
You too, Rani!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:55.240
Got it.

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:58.720
Chris, make sure you stop 
Lady Seilyn, all right?

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.860
Yeah, I'll give it my best shot!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.600
<i>Firstly, I convert all of 
my aether into mana.</i>

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.430
<i>I control it and shift into 
casting a spell...</i>

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.020
<i>I'm ready to cast!</i>

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:38.780
Freeze!

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:52.700
Oh?

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.430
Chris, are you okay?

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.920
Yeah, I think it worked.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:05.380
Hey, Lady Seilyn's okay, right?

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:08.410
Yeah, magicite beasts are tough to kill.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:11.010
I think she'll be able 
to move when it melts.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.220
Good...

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:15.110
But we need to get her away from here.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.990
I'll make her easier to move, then.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.170
She's too big right now.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:37.050
She's getting smaller!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:42.770
<i>This light... Aether? 
So he's a Divine Knight too?</i>

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:48.260
<i>But the Goddess' blessing 
is needed to create a Divine Knight.</i>

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:52.430
<i>I thought I couldn't sense her 
in this world...</i>

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.690
<i>Is there a divine existence here after all?</i>

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:02.040
The aether in her body is gone,

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:05.320
so returning her to her original size 
will be almost impossible.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:12.090
But that also means that she can never again 
grow large enough to be a threat to others.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:16.870
I hate to say it, but I couldn't do 
what you've done right now.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:19.580
Keep your promise, then. Go.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:22.800
What about the people 
in the castle and the town?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.800
We won't hurt them.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.290
Our only enemy are the Highlanders.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.880
I believe you.

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:39.360
Lady Seilyn!

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.640
Don't go!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:42.980
Lady Seilyn!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:47.170
She'll come back someday.

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.360
Really?

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:52.350
Yup. So all of you, 
stay friends with each other!

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.200
So that when she comes back, 
she'll be happy.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:57.910
Okay...

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:03.550
Bye-bye, Lady Seilyn!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.300
Come back, okay?

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:08.020
We'll be waiting!

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:13.940
Hey!

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:19.070
Lady Seilyn, stop moving 
around like that! It tickles!

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:30.250
She's so cute after the ice melted!

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:34.770
Rani, please...

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:37.850
Well, mine are too small.

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:40.700
She seems to like your breasts better.

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:42.960
Right, Lyn?

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:45.840
Lyn?

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:51.880
She's so small now! So I thought "Lyn" 
fit better than calling her "Lady Seilyn."

00:22:51.880 --> 00:22:54.080
Lyn, come on outside...

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:58.480
Stop moving around!

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:02.700
What's wrong, Rani?

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:09.940
I still don't know who was right 
and who was wrong this time.

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:14.480
The Bloodchain Brigade said they 
were trying to protect the town.

00:23:14.480 --> 00:23:16.020
Yup.

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.730
It just makes my head hurt!

00:23:19.730 --> 00:23:21.570
That's just part of being young.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.970
No, I don't think so...

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:26.060
It doesn't bother you, Chris?

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:27.960
Yup. 'Cause I don't think about it.

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:33.110
As long as you only think about 
getting stronger, it won't bother you.

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:34.600
Want to try it, Rani?

00:23:35.650 --> 00:23:37.470
I'll pass.

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:39.300
Then think about it all you like.

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:41.670
I'm always on your side, okay?

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:43.660
Yeah, thanks!

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:49.850
<b>Do something!</b>

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:49.850
<b>Paradise</b>

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:49.850
Comic by Kuromura Moto
